<description>
Part 1 of 2, reviving #24361.

Ports the two test-only commits from the original PR above, re-applied against the current <code>descriptor_tests.cpp</code> — the original no longer applies cleanly, since <code>DoCheck()</code>'s signature has changed substantially since the original PR was created back in 2022.

`norm_prv` was dropped, and `op_desc_id`, `spender_nlocktime`, `spender_nsequence`, `preimages`, `expected_prv`/`expected_pub`, and `desc_index` were all added - so the original diff no longer applies...

